This is to demonstrate that GPM and BGPM macros can leave definitions
behind.



{defs A} => 
Defining Aa

Defining Ab

Defining Ac


{defs B} => 
Defining Ba

Defining Bb

Defining Bc


{defs C} => 
Defining Ca

Defining Cb

Defining Cc



{Aa xxx} => Macro Aa called with argument xxx
{Bb yyy} => Macro Bb called with argument yyy
{Cc zzz} => Macro Cc called with argument zzz

End of test
